---
layout: base.liquid
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Hey, I'm Joe.</h1>
  <p>I'm a software engineer in upstate New York. I've been building for the web for a while now and it still feels like magic to me — especially the moment someone uses a thing I built and says, "Wait! I didn't know you could do that."</p>
  <p>When I'm not writing code, I'm probably chasing my kids around or tinkering with a side project. This is where I write about what I'm building and what I'm figuring out.</p>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <h2>Recent Posts</h2>
  {% assign recent = collections.posts | reverse %}
  {% if recent.size > 0 %}
    {% for post in recent limit: 5 %}
      <article class="post-preview">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}">{{ post.date | date: "%B %d, %Y" }}</time>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
    <p class="empty-state">Nothing here yet — check back soon.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
